{"id":"7ec3a18296008ab1","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Quotient Name","display":"df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name — ZFC Forcing Quotient Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name — ZFC Forcing Quotient Name","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name — ZFC Forcing Quotient Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,P,\\leq_P,G,p,q,r\\in V\">\\(Q,P,\\leq_P,G,p,q,r\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientName}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientName}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\varnothing\\neq G\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\n\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\n\\land Q=\\{q\\in P:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pp)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\varnothing\\neq G\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\n\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\n\\land Q=\\{q\\in P:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pp)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientName}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientName}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical predicate defines the quotient carrier determined by a filter\non a declared forcing order.  The historical ``quotient name'' symbol is\nretained only as an alias for this interpreted carrier; it is not confused\nwith the raw syntax of a forcing name.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q,P,\\leq_P,G,p,q,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientName}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land\\varnothing\\neq G\\subseteq P\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\n\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\to q\\in G)\n\\land Q=\\{q\\in P:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Pp)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}name} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientName}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingQuotientCarrier}_S(Q,P,\\leq_P,G)","display":true}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1979","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-quotient-name]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}